#: ../../source/docs/advanced-configuration-settings.rst:7
#: df529e3884f24286a670aa94cd44dd62
msgid ""
"Almost all user-modifiable settings in APM can be configured in your ground "
"station via MAVLink. However, if for any reason you want to change the "
"defaults, you can do so by modifying the APM_Config.h file, and then "
"compiling and loading the code in Arduino. Because we are editing computer "
"software we need to speak in computer language, which is done in "
"\"Declarations\" in the APM_Config.h file."
msgstr ""
"APM 中几乎所有用户可修改的设置都可以通过 MAVLink 在地面站进行配置。但如果出于任何原因需要更改默认值，可以通过修改 APM_Config.h"
" 文件，然后在 Arduino 中编译并加载代码来实现。由于我们是在编辑计算机软件，需要使用计算机语言，这在 APM_Config.h "
"文件的「Declarations」部分完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-configuration-settings.rst:14
#: 3e6e108c9c1b42e49fed1e1574b430c8
msgid ""
"To change from the default values or turn on a feature, paste the relevant "
"line from the below (keeping or changing its value as desired) in the\\ "
"``APM_Config.h`` file in the APM code, then upload your code to the APM "
"board. You must remove the \\ ``//`` in front of a line for it to be "
"recognized by Arduino; \\ ``//`` means \"comment\"."
msgstr ""
"要从默认值更改或启用某项功能，请将以下相关行粘贴到 APM 代码的 ``APM_Config.h`` 文件中（根据需要保留或更改其值），然后将代码上传到"
" APM 飞控板。必须去掉行前的 ``//`` 才能被 Arduino 识别；``//`` 表示「注释」。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-configuration-settings.rst:20
#: a21aee0b2f1c47db8d5c9dad7512c7d3
msgid ""
"If you have a APM1280 board and are finding the code is too big to compile "
"and load with Arduino, you will need to turn off some memory-hogging "
"features. A guide to doing that is \\ `here "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/getting-the-most-out-of-your>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果您有 APM1280 飞控板，发现代码太大无法使用 Arduino 编译和加载，则需要关闭一些占用内存的功能。相关指南见 `此处 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/getting-the-most-out-of-your>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-configuration-settings.rst:25
#: 062b50b9c18e4043be5f4d98a880fc4a
msgid ""
"Avoid changing too many options at once; test the effect of each change as "
"you go."
msgstr "避免一次更改太多选项；逐步测试每次更改的效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-configuration-settings.rst:28
#: 40fb25aeb2f7493aaaafd4194d0b77ca
msgid ""
"Resist the temptation to copy the entire APM_Config.h.reference file - the "
"set of valid options may change as the software evolves and it's best to "
"keep your changes separate. Do not edit the config.h header; this file sets "
"the defaults for options that you have not adjusted in APM_Config.h, and it "
"needs to stay in sync with the rest of the APM code."
msgstr ""
"请克制复制整个 APM_Config.h.reference 文件的冲动——随着软件演进，有效选项集可能发生变化，最好将您的更改单独保存。不要编辑 "
"config.h 头文件；该文件为 APM_Config.h 中未调整的选项设置默认值，需要与 APM 代码的其余部分保持同步。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-configuration-settings.rst:35
#: 8d86b4dca0d4441ea673b43bd3f1e760
msgid ""
"This is a copy of the APM_Config.h.reference file for reference - note that "
"the version in your Sketchbook may have been updated since this copy was "
"taken."
msgstr ""
"这是 APM_Config.h.reference 文件的副本，供参考——请注意，自本副本截取以来，您的 Sketchbook 中的版本可能已更新。"
